  "description": "Light, lemony scones with pops of juicy blueberries, and nothing to get in the way of the fruit's bright flavor.",
  "notes": "Optional or for serving: Toasted or turbinado sugar, to taste (optional)\n\nNotes: To keep the flavor of the scones neutral, reach for refined coconut oil; if you'd prefer a slightly tropical aroma, try virgin coconut oil instead. In either case, it's important to use cans of unsweetened, full-fat coconut milk, not the stuff that's watered down and sold in refrigerated cartons.",
